    <ownedComment xmi:id="17e38b00-a14a-4cfa-91e4-1dd7f55fbbb5">
      <body>This model has the IoMT and TVRA profiles applied.

It is compatible with the Threat, Risk  and Vulnerability  Analysis tool from the Medsecurance Project, which uses the Spyderisk tool.</body>
    </ownedComment>
